            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carol Shorter Hicks"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really a nice fresh-tasting salad and nice to look at too with the variety of colors. I found it a little bland so added about 1 teaspoon of ranch dressing mix. That did it! Really great taste and good for you too! What more could you ask for? Will definitely make often, especially when the garden squash and zucchini are about to take over!"
          },
