              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Roger"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This salad goes into my recipe box. The only alteration that I did was to use one teaspoon of ranch salad dressing mix. Thanks for the great recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2012-06-05T10:18:19.130Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
